            "review_title": "Review at Third House Coffee",
            "review_text": "Jamie\nDa Nang, Vietnam15 contributions\n0\nHigly Recommendation\nSep 2023 • Solo\nA such of perfect place to drink coffee if you are a coffeeholic. In the small valey, the industrial design that gave it a sleek and stylish look. The staff were friendly and efficient, quickly taking my order and preparing my coffee.\n\nSignature coffee (like cold brew, creative with espresso base) was good, with a decent creamy flavor and aroma. Latte aslo be must tried here with smooth mouthfeel between esp base and milk foam.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 19, 2023\nThe Third House\nThank you very much for taking the time to review us!\n\nIt's always an absolute pleasure to read reviews with a title like yours.\n\nWe wish you all the best and hope to welcome you back soon.\nRead more\nWritten September 19, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
